odecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3761450/extras/0e7ce25983e2b91768274b43779f93c9.mp4?t=1752844394\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EXPLORE A WORLD RICH IN DETAIL</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>vast city of Ocean City</strong> lets you play in a <strong>rich open world</strong>, where you can cause chaos in the streets, drive and customize a wide range of vehicles, buy properties around the city, party at nightclubs, or grab a burger at a fast food joint.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3761450/extras/31867ec67553233c9159b40e572bc374.poster.avif?t=1752844394\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3761450/extras/31867ec67553233c9159b40e572bc374.webm?t=1752844394\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3761450/extras/31867ec67553233c9159b40e572bc374.mp4?t=1752844394\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
